SORTIE 1: THE COMMAND BUNKER. STRIKE 4, SEAD 2, ESCORT 2.
WOPR SCRAMBLES INTERCEPTORS: 4.
ESCORTS: INTERCEPTORS DOWN 1, DRIVEN OFF 1; ESCORTS LOST 0.
INTERCEPTORS: SHOT DOWN 1, TURNED BACK 0; INTERCEPTORS LOST 0.
SEAD: SITES DESTROYED 2, SUPPRESSED 0; AIRCRAFT LOST 0.
SAMS: SHOT DOWN 0, TURNED BACK 0.
OVER THE COMMAND BUNKER: AIRCRAFT 3, HITS 2, LOST TO FLAK 1.
